-- Master Mounts: zone borders. GENERATED.
--
-- Where you can walk, ride or fly from one zone into the next, and the exact
-- spot on each side.
--
-- This is what makes the travel graph a WORLD rather than a set of islands.
-- Without it Orgrimmar's zeppelin tower is unreachable from Durotar -- the
-- zone it physically sits inside -- because every other edge we have stays
-- within a single zone. Every "no route" across a continent traced back here.
--
-- The crossing itself is priced at a few seconds: the two coordinates are the
-- same piece of ground seen from either side. The real cost is reaching the
-- border, which the within-zone edges already carry.
